  "dct_description_sm": [
    "To measure the thickness and extent of multiyear landfast sea ice along the northern coast of Ellesmere Island.  This ice type can be considered incipient ice shelf, yet its age and thickness are poorly constrained.  Also, there may be small ice shelf fragments embedded among this ice that have not been detected using remote sensing."
